{
  "intro": [
    {
      "text": "The ten classical elements of Vorin teaching, used to describe what the world is made of.",
      "revealedIn": [{ "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "prelude" }]
    }
  ],
  "description": [
    {
      "text": "Every Essence has its own gemstone. To Soulcast something into a new substance, a Soulcaster fabrial needs the gem that matches that substance's Essence.",
      "revealedIn": [{ "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "prelude" }]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Vorin teaching every Essence is linked to one of the Heralds and to the divine attributes that Herald stands for, as well as to many other ideas and substances.",
      "revealedIn": [{ "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "prelude" }]
    },
    {
      "text": "Vorin doctrine also gives each Essence a Body Focus, a link to some part or function of the human body.",
      "revealedIn": [{ "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "prelude" }]
    },
    {
      "text": "Each stance of Vorin swordplay is tied to one of the Essences.",
      "revealedIn": [{ "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "19" }]
    }
  ],
